 "note": "Own from-scratch base demo (docs/OWN_BASE_0P3B.md): ~0.3B dense Llama-shaped model, own 32,768-token byte-level BPE, 6B tokens first (Chinchilla-sized), extendable to 20B. About 40% Taiwanese Traditional Chinese, 40% English, 8% Simplified Chinese, the rest maths. Only sources whose card licence is on the allow list; code (the-stack-v2) and Ultra-FineWeb stay out until their licences are reviewed. license_verified stays false until fetch_mixture.py reads each card at the downloaded revision. 2026-11-13: lianghsun/fineweb-zhtw and fineweb-2-zhtw are gone from the Hub and twinkle-ai/fineweb-zhtw-filtered has no data files, so Traditional Chinese now comes from zh_TW C4, the Traditional-labelled part of FineWeb-2 cmn_Hani and zh Wikipedia.",
